in the earth and the like of it with it by which to ransom themselves from the punishment of the Day of Resurrection, it will not be accepted from them, and for them is a painful punishment.","j":6,"h":12,"s":5,"a":36,"sd":null}],"juz":6,"hizb":12,"surahs":[5],"sajdah":false}